window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>Greed is lethal. Blood is honest.</i></b></p> <p>Between the blood of gods and monsters, I am both killer and healer.</p> <p>The Darkhavens were once my obstacle. Now, they may be the only safe haven I have left.</p> <p>The Gods are lying to us all. They are not Gods at all, but creatures that came from another world to rule over ours.</p> <p>Through blood, death, and pain, I will uncover what they have hidden from us and I will reveal their secrets.</p> <p>I am Kiera Nezerac of the Hinterlands, daughter of the Divine. Assassin of the Underworld. And I am not leaving this world without the truth.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
